      "message": "docs(process): clearer fork-sync exception and release-notes wording (PROCESS_VERSION 2)\n\nReview nits from #682:\n- The fork rule said conflicts are merged \"never into the fork's main\",\n  which the new process-file sync overrides; it now says process files\n  are the one exception.\n- Cut step 2's dash aside about the \"Process changes\" section is now a\n  plain sentence; the commit text `docs: X.Y.Z release notes; changelog`\n  is unchanged.\n\nBumps .claude/PROCESS_VERSION to 2 (AGENTS.md changed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
